---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import {posts} from '../data/posts';import {url} from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="文字" active="journal"><header class="collection-header"><div><p class="eyebrow">WORDS & FIELD NOTES</p><h1>照片之外，写一点。</h1><p class="lede">日常、记录，还有尚未成形的想法。</p></div><span class="edition">{String(posts.length).padStart(2,'0')} NOTES</span></header><section class="text-list">{posts.map(post=><a class="article-row" href={url(`p/${post.slug}/`)}><div><h2>{post.title}</h2><p>{post.tags.join(' / ')} &nbsp; ↗</p></div><time>{post.date.slice(0,10)}</time></a>)}<p class="demo-note">保留原博客中的内容，下一篇从这里继续。</p></section></Layout>
